#DESCRIPTION
Conducting-field wall test of the semi-implicit field solver at a large time step: the tophat EM pulse (Ey/Bz step) of PARAM.in.fields in vacuum, with c*dt/dx = 3.5 and theta = 0.5 (energy conserving without the extended div(E) stencil), reflects off the conducting x-faces for 80 steps. Total EM energy must be conserved to the linear-solver tolerance; with an inconsistent wall BC in the GMRES operator the energy grows at every reflection.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-10.0                   xMin
 10.0                   xMax
-0.5                    yMin
 0.5                    yMax
-0.5                    zMin
 0.5                    zMax

#NCELL
40                      nCellX
1                       nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
10                      maxBlockSizeX
1                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
F                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#SOLVEEM
T                       solveEM

#PARTICLES
0                       nParticlePerCellX   vacuum
0                       nParticlePerCellY
1                       nParticlePerCellZ

#PLASMA
1                       nSpecies
0.01                    mass
-1.0                    charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
100.0                   rho
0.0                     ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
1.0e4                   T
0.0                     bx
0.0                     by
0.0                     bz
0.0                     ex
0.0                     ey
0.0                     ez

#NORMALIZATION
1.0                     lNormSI
1.0                     uNormSI

#TESTCASE
tophat                  testCase

#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
conducting              fieldBoxBoundaryLo
conducting              fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryLo
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
1.75                    dt          c*dt/dx = 3.5

#DISCRETIZATION
0.50                    theta
0.0                     ratioDivC2C

#MONITOR
10                      dnReport
100                     dnReportLB
T                       doCompact

#SAVELOG
1                       dnSavePic
1                       dnSavePT

#DIVE
F                       doCorrectDivE

#RESAMPLING
F                       doReSampling

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 var ascii pic       plotString
-1                      dnSavePlot
35.0                    dtSavePlot
-1                      dxSavePlot
Ey Bz Ex Ez Bx By       plotVar

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
140.0                   TimeMax     80 steps, 7 wall-to-wall transits
